@@ -3,3 +3,19 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()`, exported from `src/index.ts`, is an in-memory service for renting boards and
+sails by the day. It offers three operations:
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })` adds an item. `kind` is `'board'` or `'sail'`, and
+  `dailyPrice` is the price of one day in euro cents.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns `{ itemId, start, end, total }`, the price of the period.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` books the item and returns `{ id, itemId, start, end, total }`. It
+  throws when the item is already booked for an overlapping period.
+
+A period starts and ends at UTC midnight, written as `YYYY-MM-DDT00:00:00Z`, and ends at the start of the
+day after its last day. Cancellations are not implemented yet.
+
+Build and test with `npm install` followed by `npm test`.
