+---
+id: task-001-rental-module-quote-and-book-equipment
+type: task
+title: "Rental module: quote and book equipment"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Request
+
+Add a rental module to the booking desk, starting with the basics. Export `createRentalService()`
+from `src/index.ts`. The in-memory service offers `addEquipment`, `quote` and `book`, and follows the
+school's five rules: integer cents, UTC ISO-8601 times, whole days from midnight to midnight, no
+overlapping bookings of one item, and the cancellation policy. Cancellations are out of scope for
+this task.
+
+# Work
+
+- Tests first, in `src/rental.test.ts`, covering the happy path and the error paths.
+- Implementation in `src/rental.ts`, re-exported from `src/index.ts`.
+- Design choices are recorded in dl-001, dl-002 and dl-003.
+
+# Result
+
+- `npm test` builds with strict TypeScript and runs 19 tests, all passing: happy and error paths for
+  quote, book, addEquipment and the date rules.
+- Cancellations are not implemented, as the request asked.
+- Not done: the cancellation policy (rule 5) has no code yet.
